OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog calls for pause on AI    
OL,4,Adata centres in Wales                  
OL,6,FA Welsh watchdog has called for a pause
OL,7,Fon the approval of new AI data centres 
OL,8,Funtil safeguards are in place.         
OL,10,FFuture Generations Commissioner Derek  
OL,11,FWalker said decisions about large-scale
OL,12,Fprojects should not be made without    
OL,13,Ftheir long-term impact being taken into
OL,14,Faccount.                               
OL,16,FIt follows moves by the Welsh          
OL,17,Fgovernment to take responsibility for  
OL,18,Fthe planning process for a scheme in   
OL,19,FCardiff because of the "substantial    
OL,20,Fcontroversy" the plans had generated.  
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
